  "full_text": "The purpose of man is to entertain God. Entertain God and your ass will fall out. So we have no territorial, we have no desire for territory. That would just get the fuck out, get you losers out of here. So like, we will entertain God, you know, and do the righteousness of God. I don't know if we're going to be do-gooders. We could just like do Viking shit just to fucking entertain God. Because, like, there's no better reason for war than no reason. I'm disgusted with CIA propaganda. They try to do their little mind games and shit. It's like, fuck that. Just do it for the fuck of it, you know? So, like, entertain God and your ass will follow. Maybe you have some other way you think you could entertain God. You know, like, ask yourself, all you citizens of the world. Our job is to entertain God. How can we do that? How are you going to do it? Some other way. What are you going to do? The Pope's going to do Cirque du Soleil. God's going to say, get the fuck out, Pope. The Pope's going to do fucking Cirque du Soleil. Oh, my God.",
